\begin{proposition}\label{prop:forgetful}
	Let $L\subset(\Sigma^*)^n$ be an $n$-regular language. If $\theta_{\#}\colon(\Sigma^*)^n\to(\Sigma\cup \{\#\})^*$ is the map $(w_1,w_2,\ldots,w_n)\mapsto w_1\#^{\epsilon_1} w_2\#^{\epsilon_2} \cdots \#^{\epsilon_n} w_n$,
