+        "recognizing that form, the bounded exact route scans a large interval."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: exact O(W) discriminant scanning averages 103400 iterations, "
+        "1447610 counted exact operations, and 0.39 seconds at shipping "
+        "n=250007, while recognizing the affine Pell form takes at most 156 "
+        "exact operations in the measured panel."
