    over the alphabet \(\{a, \ a^{-1}, \ \#\}\). The language \(L\) is EDT0L;
    our system will have the extended alphabet \(\{\perp, \ \#, \ a, \
    a^{-1}\}\) and rational control defined by Figure \ref{a^na^n_fig}.
