  2282	
  2283	Finally, this survey would not have been written without the essential contributions to the area of many mathematicians and valued collaborators: Volker Diekert, Andrew Duncan, Murray Elder, Alex Evetts, Derek Holt, Sarah Rees, to name just a few.
  2284	
