codex
The improved compact solver lowers the shipping worst case from 259 to 189 operations, creating more G9 headroom. The post-shipping sweep also confirms that operation cost is non-monotone because some transformed boxes straddle multiple Pell sign branches; I’m keeping only escalation rungs that were actually measured under the cap.
